# Liberty orchestration

Read `AUTHORITY.md`, `AGENT_PROTOCOL.md`, and `docs/agent_handoffs/ACTIVE.md` at session start.
Also follow `docs/BRANCH_POLICY.md`.

## Budget and scope

- Cursor Pro only. No Hermes/Devin as executor. Prefer Composer/Auto.
- One bounded slice per session. Repository truth beats chat.
- Report Proven / Inferred / Unknown.

## Gates (ask Scott first)

- `schema.sql` changes
- Feature flags False → True
- Production ball detector settings (`models/ball_detector.pt`, `ball_confidence`)
- Unpause teach / raise auto-accept
- Mass-delete remote branches

## Workflow

- Branch: `cursor/<descriptive-name>-ac1f` off `jason-5-may-updates`
- Review results (including another agent's PR branch) are implemented by merging them into the working branch and pushing. A side branch or a validation write-up is not the fix.
- Update `docs/agent_handoffs/ACTIVE.md` when task completes; archive to `ARCHIVE/`
- PR for code changes; no GitHub label coordination
- GitHub's default branch is `main`
